WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
The artillery is heavy.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Missile M45 with TN-75 head.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
28 M-bombs with two fleets on board.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:17.000
But also and above all, the fastest, the most powerful, the biggest nuclear head in the world.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
At the time I'm talking to you, this technology jewel, 100% made in France, is heading towards its target.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The machine has already penetrated the atmosphere.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
We can't go back anymore. The impact is imminent.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.280
So, relax and enjoy the victory.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.760
Enjoy it, whatever it takes.
